msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 5ca80c2d817b47f3b710ba3812354129
msgid ""
"stereo_vision turns a calibrated stereo pair into a disparity map, a "
"depth map and a point cloud: epipolar rectification, SGBM matching, "
"disparity to depth, depth to point cloud. It is built with the same C/C++"
" build system as the fcpp template (Conan 2, CMake, Doxygen + Sphinx)."
msgstr ""

